    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cQuiet Dan\u201d</strong> is a provocative work in the format of a visual novel, blurring the boundaries between ordinariness and existential crisis. The protagonist, Dan, a resident of suburban New York City, loses his job as a janitor and sinks into an abyss of loneliness, inner demons, and social injustice. His actions are contradictory and sometimes violent, making the narrative suspenseful and realistic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543420/extras/da4f446665630b3ed705dc443512e6f0.poster.avif?t=1750093359\" width=800 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543420/extras/da4f446665630b3ed705dc443512e6f0.webm?t=1750093359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543420/extras/da4f446665630b3ed705dc443512e6f0.mp4?t=1750093359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully voiced one-man performance:</strong> the entire text of the novel is fully voiced and dictated on the fly, without subsequent edits, which gives the story liveliness and a sense of \u201craw\u201d reality. This creates the effect of a theatrical monologue, where Dan's thoughts and dialogues sound as natural as possible</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre mix:</strong> includes elements of psychological thriller, social drama and philosophical nonconformism. The work has been compared to \u00abAmerican Psycho\u00bb and \u00abFight Club\u00bb for its dark atmosphere and exploration of human degradation.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cQuiet Dan\u201d</strong> is a provocative work in the format of a visual novel, blurring the boundaries between ordinariness and existential crisis. The protagonist, Dan, a resident of suburban New York City, loses his job as a janitor and sinks into an abyss of loneliness, inner demons, and social injustice. His actions are contradictory and sometimes violent, making the narrative suspenseful and realistic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543420/extras/da4f446665630b3ed705dc443512e6f0.poster.avif?t=1750093359\" width=800 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543420/extras/da4f446665630b3ed705dc443512e6f0.webm?t=1750093359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543420/extras/da4f446665630b3ed705dc443512e6f0.mp4?t=1750093359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully voiced one-man performance:</strong> the entire text of the novel is fully voiced and dictated on the fly, without subsequent edits, which gives the story liveliness and a sense of \u201craw\u201d reality. This creates the effect of a theatrical monologue, where Dan's thoughts and dialogues sound as natural as possible</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre mix:</strong> includes elements of psychological thriller, social drama and philosophical nonconformism. The work has been compared to \u00abAmerican Psycho\u00bb and \u00abFight Club\u00bb for its dark atmosphere and exploration of human degradation.</p>",
